You are implementing Task 5 from a plan to make conversations session-scoped.

## Context
The backend now filters/creates conversations by `X-Session-ID` header. The frontend needs to send this header on conversation API calls.

The component tree is:
```
main.tsx → SessionProvider (generates sessionId via UUID, provides via useSessionId hook)
  App.tsx → uses useSessionId() to get sessionId
    ConversationProvider (currently no sessionId prop)
      AgentProvider (already uses useSessionId)
        AppContent
          Sidebar (currently no sessionId prop)
            ConversationHistory (fetches /api/conversations without header)
```

## What to change

### 1. `frontend/src/contexts/ConversationContext.tsx`

Change `ConversationProvider` to accept `sessionId` prop:

```typescript
export function ConversationProvider({ children, sessionId }: { children: ReactNode; sessionId: string }) {
```

Update `createConversation` to include `X-Session-ID` header:
```typescript
const createConversation = useCallback(async (firstMessage: string): Promise<string> => {
    const title = firstMessage.length > 50 ? firstMessage.slice(0, 50) + '...' : firstMessage;
    const res = await fetch('/api/conversations', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'X-Session-ID': sessionId },
      body: JSON.stringify({ title }),
    });
    const conv = await res.json();
    setActiveConversationId(conv.id);
    triggerRefresh();
    return conv.id;
  }, [triggerRefresh, sessionId]);
```

### 2. `frontend/src/components/ConversationHistory.tsx`

Add `sessionId: string` to the `ConversationHistoryProps` interface.

Update `fetchConversations` to include `X-Session-ID` header:
```typescript
const fetchConversations = useCallback(async () => {
    try {
      const res = await fetch('/api/conversations', {
        headers: { 'X-Session-ID': sessionId },
      });
      if (res.ok) {
        setConversations(await res.json());
      }
    } catch {
      // Sidebar fetch failure: show empty list
    }
  }, [sessionId]);
```

Don't forget to destructure `sessionId` from props in the component function signature.

### 3. `frontend/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`

Add `sessionId: string` to `SidebarProps` interface.

Pass it to `ConversationHistory`:
